  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering agents of change for freedom of religion or belief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aim at equipping and empowering agents of change that understand, respect and engage in promoting freedom of religion or belief (FoRB) in their contexts. The project will develop FoRB educational tools and resources and using them in trainings, as well as strengthen access to justice for individuals or groups that do not enjoy FoRB.</narrative>
  </description>
